<title>FINLAND: STARCKJOHANN BUYS MERCANTILE METALS OPS.</title>
<headline>STARCKJOHANN BUYS MERCANTILE METALS OPS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish hardware group Starckjohann Oy and trading house Oy Mercantile Ab said in a joint statement on Friday that Starckjohann had bought Mercantile's steel and metals trading operations.</p>
<p>Combined net sales of the units being transferred were 230 million markka in 1995, they said.</p>
<p>The operations were bought by Starckjohann's Rauta Starckjohann Oy unit, which had net sales of 628 million markka last year.</p>
</text>
